<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Oct 21.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Oct 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>No milling wheat 11 pct protein trade was reported.</p>
<p>Feed wheat Suffolk Nov 100.00.</p>
<p>Cardiff Oct 98.50.</p>
<p>Avonmouth Nov 100.00 Jan/Mar 102.00.</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Nov 99.00 Jan/Mar 100.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 100.00.</p>
<p>Feed barley to Southampton Nov 101.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Oct 100.50 Nov 101.00/101.50.</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Nov 100.00.</p>
</text>
